  "notes": [
    "**Renunciar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **renunciado** (regular)",
    "Often used with \"a\": *renunciar a algo* (to give up something, to renounce something)",
    "Common usage: *renunciar al trabajo* (to quit one's job), *renunciar a un derecho* (to waive a right)",
